<title>UK: April Ekofisk programme up two at 33 cargoes-trade.</title>
<headline>April Ekofisk programme up two at 33 cargoes-trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Ekofisk crude oil pipeline system is to load 33 cargoes in April, up two from March, trade sources said.</p>
<p>The April programme will consist of nine cargoes of 600,000 barrels, one of 700,000 barrels and 23 cargoes of 500,000 barrels.</p>
</text>
